OL,3,GNEWSADan Thomas resigns as Reform Wales
OL,4,Aleader after arrest on suspicion of
OL,5,Aassault
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK's Dan Thomas has quit as the
OL,8,Fparty's Welsh leader after he was
OL,9,Farrested on Sunday on suspicion of
OL,10,Fassault and controlling or coercive
OL,11,Fbehaviour.
OL,13,FGwent Police confirmed that a
OL,14,F45-year-old man from Aberbargoed, in
OL,15,FCaerphilly, was bailed pending further
OL,16,Fenquiries.
OL,18,FIn a statement issued by his party, the
OL,19,FMember of the Senedd for Casnewydd
OL,20,FIslwyn said he was "standing down" from
OL,21,Fhis position for "personal reasons".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
